      "name": "Eft Music Extended",
      "slug": "eft-music-extended",
      "teaser": "Ever wanted more main menu music that resemble Escape From Tarkov music genre? Search no more!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2247.jpg",
      "downloads": 3239,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<p><strong>Require <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/41072-bobby-renzobbi/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bobby Renzobbi</a>’s <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2250-dynamic-soundtrack-custom-menu-music-bobby-s-music-player/#tab_704e32d7b189fb40b70c8286b0b5ed814480c138\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Bobby’s Music Player</a>.</strong></p>\n<p>This pack include all the vanilla main menu music + some additional made by Nikita for game’s Trailers or that does not appear in Live tarkov but that could fit in the game.</p>\n<p><strong>New music included:</strong><br />\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">geneburn</a> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/follow-the-leader\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Follow the Leader</a></p>\n<p>geneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/concrete-whispers\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Concrete Whispers</a><br />\ngeneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/intermezzo\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Intermezzo</a></p>\n<p>geneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/left-behind\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Left Behind</a></p>\n<p>geneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/exfiltration\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Exfiltration</a></p>\n<p>geneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/countdown\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Countdown</a></p>\n<p>geneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QqMTHKdJcqM\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">0.15 Trailer Music</a></p>\n<p><strong>Optional:</strong></p>\n<p>geneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/edge-of-darkness\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Edge Of Darkness</a></p>\n<p>geneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/war-goes-hot-raw-edit\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">War goes hot (raw edit)</a><br />\ngeneburn <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://soundcloud.com/geneburn/wings\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Wings (2005 raw edit)</a> (Hideout Song)</p>\n",
